<description>&lt;p&gt;Violence continues in South Sudan with a grenade explosion that killed four children and injured two in Northern Bahr el Ghazal, and clashes between Warrap and Lakes communities that left 14 dead. The government dispatched 25 young professionals to Brazil for specialized farming training and President Salva Kiir traveled to Ethiopia. UNHCR and South Sudan officials held talks to improve support for refugees in Egypt. Four individuals received 14-year prison sentences for a sexual assault case in Sherikat. The UCDP recorded two battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxNZ1BSWHJMaG1uRFFnYU5TUUIwMS14bzlFVkxuR21razB5d2Ytc3pkckhNWWNXQjI5OW15OTkwZnFVd0tULXdCS3RIVTNiX1doSTZTNVRTMWFwYkdNWHp2dXhURUFWTTJGNUNlR3NNb2hrUXE5b1puWjV6MnVQdnp0d2V3akhWdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPcmZKNFUybE14RGh6TGlBS29IaUUtLXVCZDUxZ0tvSmVEWnpvcXY0bm90R19QdGxqQm9JeU1IeVRPX2R4blVZUG5ubDFnNmFUYVhfLWRjWXhMdkptejk4MXVyNVZ4VC0zazVvRFR2MVFjclMyYU01eW4ta3ZHWGxuRGdKRFdrOV9MTDFFMnFNd1NhYkF4SVp3YVJB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Şafak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQQzB1WnJNdkxtSndrb2xUQ0ozdVFNRllpTGljdk9ncEYyOEFVdkZ3UW1YaVVqUmkyRFVuZEtiR1BIOXUtUjJqaGlsWTNyUnc5M3FBUFVKd3ZQaUtqQ2dGeDhHTllKUUNPb0g4dHFkWGc2TldUQjExRW8yUnlib0VfQ2JHcGhfeXptVEdJUkFfdWUyTUswWFRDdVJOVmRPdlA4QXhjQ2pvYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Monitor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Monitor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPMTVDcnRhUl9CT0FBMUdDU2xBM2drR1dZd3NlLWtUdEs1Y0pPbGx3alZKaDhSQ1p0cDlsOGNleUswWDdFa1hKeE12NGRyWWh2NmdCcXpmd1V0NTNMLXBkQm43TWNjNEllVU5lVUxZdzZZWUFmV1ZaUFczMzhSdzNLX09ia2x4cTFTUDB2SXAtc2RCSWRLczAzLVMy